Z||000000||Ralfy9862||10-05-2000||06:45 PM||||Where exactly would that be ? I just took my stereo out and touched the two pink wires to the yellow wire comming from the stereo harness and the sub just makes wierd noises<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||StuGood||10-05-2000||10:09 PM||||It's the "weird noise enable" wire  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">.<P>Actually, according to my wiring diagram, if your car is equipped with factory subamp, there's more than one yellow fellow:<P>One seems to be a feed from the (10amp) radio fuse.  A second goes to one side of the LR speaker.  The third goes to one side of an amplifer switch in the domelight module.    ||||reg||6
Z||000002||tgowens||10-05-2000||11:31 PM||||Ralfy9862, the two pink wires from the amp should go to the yellow wire from the vehicle wiring harness, not the radio harness.......<P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/tgowens_sig.gif">                        <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A> - Blue '87 GT - Gold '87 GT||||reg||1
